Understanding DITA Topics
It is important to understand the role that a DITA topic plays in a DITA project. A DITA topic is not associated 
with a single published document. It is a separate entity that can potentially be included in many different 
books, help systems, or websites. Therefore, when you write a DITA topic you are not writing a book, a help 
system, or a website. You are writing an individual piece of content. This affects how you approach the writing 
task and how Oxygen XML Editor works to support you as you write
